ana → Fleet → Agents → composants en erreur, output ES de la policy\nDashboards :\n[Elastic Agent] Concerning Agents - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/elastic_agent-0600ffa0-6b5e-11ed-98de-67bdecd21824\n[Elastic Agent] Overview - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/elastic_agent-a148dc70-6b3c-11ed-98de-67bdecd21824\n[Elastic Agent] Agent metrics - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/elastic_agent-f47f18cc-9c7d-4278-b2ea-a6dee816d395\nFleet :\nFleet → Agents - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/fleet/agents\nDoc :\nPilotage des agents - https://github.com/France-Travail/pass-emploi-tools/blob/master/docs/observabilite/pilotage.md{% if foreach.item.labels %}{% if foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url | split: '@@' %}{% else %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels | map: 'dependabot_url' | compact | uniq %}{% endif %}{% if pages.size > 0 %}\nAlertes Dependabot :{% for u in pages %}{% assign morceaux = u | split: '/' %}\n{{ morceaux[4] }} - {{ u }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endif %}\nRègle :\n{{ event.rule.name | replace: '=', '＝' }} - {{ event.ruleUrl }}{% when '3c65ffd4-165f-4d0b-b820-24be398f19fd' %}{% assign t0 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | minus: 3600 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}{% assign t1 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | plus: 900 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}🚨 Mémoire conteneur Logstash prod — un conteneur dépasse 95 % de sa limite Scalingo : OOM-kill et redémarrage imminents.\nDéclenchée à : {{ foreach.item.kibana.alert.start }}{% if event.rule.tags contains 'tchap-lignes' and foreach.item.message %}{% for ligne in foreach.item.message %}\n• {{ ligne | replace: '=', '＝' }}{% endfor %}{% elsif event.rule.tags contains 'jobs' and foreach.item.labels %}{% if foreach.item.labels.job_type %}{% assign jobs = foreach.item.labels.job